<title>INDIA: India's RBI maintains cut-off at 4.15 percent.</title>
<headline>India's RBI maintains cut-off at 4.15 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said maintained a cut-off of 4.15 percent at a repo auction.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 17 bids for 50.20 billion rupees of which it accepted 11 for 48 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off was 4.0719 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
